&lt;li&gt;Partner with engineers on long-term technical direction, design, and production reviews, supporting their ownership of technical decisions and holding the team accountable for delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate reliability and scaling challenges alongside partner-team leaders, and prioritize improvements that support upcoming product goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn lessons from work with product teams and production incidents into reusable tools and practices that strengthen partner teams’ ownership and make on-call more sustainable&lt;/li&gt;
