&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex initiatives across engineering teams and cross-functional partners, earning trust beyond your reporting line, resolving competing priorities, and delivering shared business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment about reliability, security, and sustainable operations, with clear communication and respect for engineers’ technical ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;While it’s not required, it’s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
