&lt;li&gt;As a builder and coach, you&#39;ll lead and empower the team to meet KPIs across Technical Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Support Operations to design and implement scalable processes for bug triage, investigation, and resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with our engineering partners to ensure high-quality bug reporting and strong feedback loops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and insights from Product Support Analytics to surface trends, improve product quality, and inform strategic decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop team members across Enterprise and Technical Support, emphasizing technical depth and career growth&lt;/li&gt;
