&lt;li&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Debugging Acumen: Strong background in debugging and technical quality, with the ability to interpret developer documentation and APIs, and working knowledge of web technologies (JavaScript/TypeScript, HTML, CSS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise Support Expertise: Experience supporting complex enterprise environments, including workflows related to SSO, SCIM, provisioning, and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration &amp;amp; Scaling: Proven ability to partner with cross-functional partners to resolve issues and drive improvements, while also being comfortable building new systems and processes from scratch.&lt;/li&gt;
