&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Our interns are embedded into small, collaborative engineering teams across the company. You&#39;ll work closely with your mentor and teammates to ship meaningful features, tools, or systems. Whether you&#39;re working on internal infrastructure or user-facing features, you&#39;ll get to learn, contribute, and grow in a supportive environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;This internship will be based out of our San Francisco or New York Hub with a 5/3, 5/17, 6/1 or 6/14&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;start date.&lt;/p&gt;
