&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Product: Build full stack user facing features, including new collaboration tools, new product workflows, growth oriented experiments, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Backend/Infrastructure: Build platform level tools, including distributed systems, developer tooling, performance/scalability work, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Security Engineering: Build security-focused systems, product security tooling, detection, secure infrastructure, or privacy/security features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Open: I&#39;m flexible and still exploring different types of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
