&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Be fully embedded onto a Figma engineering team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Contribute to projects that directly align with team goals and impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Collaborate with engineers, PMs, designers, and QA to break down features and plan timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build, document, and maintain tests, features, or infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Share feedback and participate in peer code review&lt;/li&gt;
