&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain enterprise services in TypeScript, REST APIs, and JSON for user, group, and membership management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement identity synchronization and lifecycle management using SCIM and related standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate services at high scale, including scheduled on-call rotations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use Infrastructure as Code (Terraform, AWS CloudFormation, Kubernetes) to deliver scalable, high-availability applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with cross-functional and peer teams to deliver large-scale projects with cross-team dependencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you need:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in TypeScript, JavaScript, React, and Node.js, with practical experience developing and improving Node.js applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SQL and web protocols such as REST, SOAP, XML, and JSON&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with security architecture and identity protocols such as LDAP, Active Directory, SAML, SSO, OAuth2, and OpenID Connect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked with access control models such as RBAC, ABAC, and ReBAC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
