&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with web fundamentals: HTML, CSS, HTTP, rendering models, and caching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with build tools such as Webpack, Turbopack, Babel, or SWC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicated clearly and collaborated in public, open-source settings&lt;/li&gt;
