&lt;li&gt;Work on the distributed-systems foundations behind scheduling, message delivery, execution, retries, and state.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, developer experience, and infrastructure teams to turn customer needs into clear, useful developer primitives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the engineering bar through thoughtful design reviews, well-tested code, production ownership, and clear technical communication.&lt;/li&gt;
