&lt;li&gt;Work closely with peer Infrastructure Platforms groups to control the impact of application code running in user facing products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help communicate the release schedule clearly with others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop monitoring and alerting to measure release process velocity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify process bottlenecks and introduce optimizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/engineering/deployments-and-releases/#release-managers&quot;&gt;Release Manager&lt;/a&gt; rotation&lt;/li&gt;
